Below is a **CSS file** that corresponds to the HTML dashboard layout. This CSS file styles the dashboard with a sidebar, main content area, and header/footer sections:

```css
/* General body styling */
body {
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  line-height: 1.6;
  background-color: #f5f5f5;
}

/* Header styling */
.dashboard-header {
  background-color: #004080;
  color: #fff;
  padding: 1.5rem;
  text-align: center;
}

.dashboard-header h1 {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 2rem;
}

.dashboard-header p {
  font-size: 1rem;
  margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
}

/* Container layout for sidebar and main content */
.dashboard-container {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: row;
  min-height: 100vh;
}

/* Sidebar styling */
.dashboard-sidebar {
  width: 240px;
  background-color: #003366;
  color: #fff;
  padding: 1rem;
  border-right: 1px solid #ccc;
}

.dashboard-sidebar h3 {
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.dashboard-sidebar ul {
  list-style-type: none;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0;
}

.dashboard-sidebar ul li {
  margin: 0.5rem 0;
}

.dashboard-sidebar ul li a {
  color: #fff;
  text-decoration: none;
  display: block;
  padding: 0.5rem;
  border-radius: 4px;
  transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
}

.dashboard-sidebar ul li a:hover {
  background-color: #0059b3;
}

/* Main content styling */
.dashboard-content {
  flex: 1;
  background-color: #fff;
  padding: 2rem;
}

.dashboard-content h2 {
  border-bottom: 2px solid #004080;
  padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  color: #004080;
}

.dashboard-content pre {
  background-color: #f8f8f8;
  border: 1px solid #ccc;
  padding: 1rem;
  border-radius: 4px;
  overflow: auto;
}

.dashboard-content code {
  font-family: Consolas, "Courier New", Courier, monospace;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  color: #d6336c;
}

/* Footer styling */
.dashboard-footer {
  background-color: #004080;
  color: #fff;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 1rem 0;
  margin-top: auto;
  border-top: 1px solid #ccc;
}

/* Responsive adjustments */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .dashboard-container {
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .dashboard-sidebar {
    width: 100%;
    border-right: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
  }
}
```

### Features of This CSS File:
1. **Header**:
   - Styled with a dark blue background (`#004080`) and white text.
   - Ensures text alignment and spacing are clean and consistent.

2. **Sidebar**:
   - Fixed width for navigation links.
   - Styled with a darker blue background (`#003366`) and interactive hover effects for links.

3. **Main Content**:
   - Takes up remaining space (`flex: 1`) and includes styled headings and code blocks.
   - Code blocks (`<pre>` and `<code>`) are highlighted with a light gray background and a distinct border.

4. **Footer**:
   - Styled to match the header, with a dark blue background and centered white text.

5. **Responsive Design**:
   - Includes a media query for screens smaller than 768px, where the layout adjusts to stack the sidebar above the main content for better usability on mobile devices.

### How to Use:
1. Save the CSS file as `prs_app.css`.
2. Ensure it is in the same directory as the HTML file, or adjust the `<link>` path in the `<head>` section of the HTML file to point to the correct location.
3. Open the HTML file in a browser, and the CSS styles will be applied automatically.

